<title>USA: Chequemate names Lane Ward president.</title>
<headline>Chequemate names Lane Ward president.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chequemate International Ic Tuesday named Lane Ward, formerly of Ameritech Corp, as president.</p>
<p>Ward replaces Chequemate's chief executive Blaine Harris, who temporarily served as the company's president. Harris remains chief executive.</p>
